/* * @lc app=leetcode id=3533 lang=kotlin * * [3533] Concatenated Divisibility */ class Solution { fun concatenatedDivisibility(nums: IntArray, k: Int): IntArray = nums.sortedArray().let { sorted -> IntArray(sorted.size) { i -> (1..if (sorted[i] == 0) 1 else Math.log10(sorted[i].toDouble()).toInt() + 1).fold(1L) { acc, _ -> (acc * 10L) % k }.toInt() }.let { pow10 -> IntArray(sorted.size).let { ans -> HashMap<Long, Boolean>().let { memo -> DeepRecursiveFunction<Pair<Int, Int>, Boolean> { (mask, rem) -> if (mask == (1 shl sorted.size) - 1) rem == 0 else ((mask.toLong() shl 32) or (rem.toLong() and 0xFFFFFFFFL)).let { key -> memo[key] ?: (0 until sorted.size).filter { (mask and (1 shl it)) == 0 }.any { i -> callRecursive((mask or (1 shl i)) to (if (mask == 0) sorted[i] % k else ((rem.toLong() * pow10[i] + sorted[i]) % k).toInt())).also { ok -> if (ok) ans[Integer.bitCount(mask)] = sorted[i] } }.also { memo[key] = it } } }.invoke(0 to 0).let { found -> if (found) ans else intArrayOf() } } } } } }